			<article><section><h1>PolyTrack 0.6.3 - Track of the Week</h1>
<time>2026-09-16</time>
<a href="/updates/media/2026-09-16.jpg"><img loading="lazy" src="/updates/media/2026-09-16.jpg" alt="Screenshot of PolyTrack"></a>
<p>This update is compatible with 0.6.0, 0.6.1 and 0.6.2, so updating is optional, but recommended to access the newest features and fixes.</p>
<ul>
	<li>Added: Track of the Week</li>
	<li>Added: New Community Tracks</li>
	<ul>
		<li>La Infinita</li>
		<li>Oyasumi</li>
		<li>Zenith</li>
		<li>Wintertide</li>
		<li>The CrossFades</li>
		<li>Out of Bounds</li>
		<li>Solaris</li>
		<li>Evanescent Bliss</li>
		<li>Atlantis</li>
		<li>Tucks Factory</li>
	</ul>
	<li>Added: Tutorial for new players</li>
	<li>Added: Community Tracks are now grouped into tabs by version</li>
	<li>Added: Spectator camera move up/down using Z/C keys</li>
	<li>Added: Links to Google Play &amp; Reddit</li>
	<li>Added: Hover over the time in the leaderboard to see the exact time a record was set</li>
	<li>Added: Icon for MacOS Desktop app</li>
	<li>Added: Longer screen timeout on mobile while playing</li>
	<br>
	<li>Changed: Timestamps in the leaderboard are now shown as relative time (e.g. "2 days ago")</li>
	<li>Changed: Reset hint design</li>
	<li>Changed: Arrow key binds are now rendered as arrows instead of text</li>
	<li>Changed: Terms of Service &amp; Privacy Policy has been combined into one button</li>
	<li>Changed: New hint text after finishing a track</li>
	<br>
	<li>Fixed: Horizontal scrollbar in garage due to a Firefox bug</li>
	<br>
	<li>Removed: Community Track "Asguardia"</li>
</ul>
</section><footer><a class="underline-button" href="/updates/2026-09-16/polytrack-0.6.3" rel="bookmark"><img src="/svg/permalink.svg" alt=""><span>Permalink</span></a></footer></article><article><section><h1>PolyTrack 0.6.2 - Bug fixes</h1>
<time>2026-05-31</time>
<a href="/updates/media/2026-05-31.jpg"><img loading="lazy" src="/updates/media/2026-05-31.jpg" alt="Screenshot of PolyTrack"></a>
<p>This update is compatible with 0.6.0 and 0.6.1, so updating is optional but recommended.</p>
<ul>
	<li>Changed: Community Track Natsu has been changed to remove the hidden finish line. Note that this means that the leaderboard for this track has been reset.</li>
	<li>Changed: Error screen replaced "Reload" button with a "Quit" button for the desktop versions of the game</li>
	<br>
	<li>Fixed: Editor camera could not be lowered as far as it should</li>
	<li>Fixed: Touch controls were not properly hidden during loading screens</li>
	<li>Fixed: Very rare error if car input was sent before the physics simulation was fully initialized</li>
	<li>Fixed: The image for the news popup was unnecessarily preloaded even when not opened</li>
</ul>
</section><footer><a class="underline-button" href="/updates/2026-05-31/polytrack-0.6.2" rel="bookmark"><img src="/svg/permalink.svg" alt=""><span>Permalink</span></a></footer></article><article><section><h1>PolyTrack 0.6.1 - New community tracks</h1>
