	<li>Added: When playing logged in on CrazyGames or Poki, your nickname will be set automatically</li>
	<li>Added: The first time the game is launched, Summer 1 will be started automatically</li>
	<li>Added: Error screen reload game button</li>
	<li>Added: Error screen reset settings button</li>
	<li>Added: 10 new community tracks</li>
	<ul>
		<li>Apostle</li>
		<li>Stardust</li>
		<li>Overclocked</li>
		<li>Amberbound</li>
		<li>The Eldritch Estate</li>
		<li>Star Bound</li>
		<li>Natsu</li>
		<li>Lenore</li>
		<li>Sandy lanes II</li>
		<li>Planet 97</li>
	</ul>
	<br>
	<li>Changed: Moved multiplayer experimental warning</li>
	<li>Changed: The speedometer is now frozen after finishing a track to make it easier to see the final speed</li>
	<li>Changed: Profile settings are now always shown when saving the car in the garage</li>
	<li>Changed: New icon for delete track button in track selection</li>
	<li>Changed: CMD-Z can now also be used on Mac in addition to CTRL-Z</li>
	<li>Changed: Android app now allows rotating between landscape and reverse landscape</li>
	<br>
	<li>Optimized: Lag spikes when editing large tracks in the editor</li>
	<li>Optimized: All official tracks are no longer preloaded when the game starts</li>
	<br>
	<li>Fixed: It was still possible to paste parts during testing in the editor</li>
