	<li>Changed: Blurred background in menu</li>
	<li>Changed: Renamed "Customization" to "Garage"</li>
	<li>Changed: When the speed difference at a checkpoint is less than 1 km/h decimals are now shown, for example "0.5 km/h"</li>
	<li>Changed: Community tracks are now in groups depending on in which version they were released</li>
