</section><footer><a class="underline-button" href="/updates/2021-09-24/dustsim-1.03" rel="bookmark"><img src="/svg/permalink.svg" alt=""><span>Permalink</span></a></footer></article><article><section><h1>DustSim 1.02 - Accessibility &amp; Aesthetics</h1>
<time>2021-02-04</time>
<p>Accessibility is an important part of this update. All buttons and settings can now be accessed with just a keyboard. Particles and poles cannot be spawned without a mouse, but at least the preconfigured scenarios can be viewed now.</p>
<p>The camera can be moved using WASD or the arrow keys and zoom can be changed with Q &amp; E. There are new shortcut keys for quickly pausing the simulation(Space or P) and for hiding the user interface(H).</p>
